00:05:54.889 --> 00:05:59.580
It’s okay, even if you never watched classic
who or the new series, Episode 1 of Series

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.779
8 is designed to explain all the basics anyway,
so don’t feel weird about jumping on if

00:06:03.779 --> 00:06:04.849
